# The generated mirrors (`lib/src/g`, `lib/src/web/g`, `lib/src/bindings`) are compared byte-for-byte
# by `dart tool/web/gen_web_bindings.dart --check`, and `dart format` keeps a file's existing line
# endings. A Windows checkout (whose Git default, `core.autocrlf=true`, rewrites LF as CRLF) would
# therefore report every generated file as out of date, so pin the working tree to LF everywhere.
# `text=auto` still leaves binaries alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
